    "element": "Air",
    "ruler": "Saturn/Rahu",
    "description": "You love and care for others, magnetic personality, logical conclusions and practical approach, Individualistic personality. You are emotionally an intense personality. You are always dedicated to social justice. You would like to actively fight for inequality in meaningful way.",
    "emotional_nature": "Your biggest strength is your intuition and the ability to uncover hidden information through research work. You will have the strength of revealing the inner strengths. Excel in weighing the evidence and showcasing them in a logical way.\n\nYou would always be on a quest for knowledge and often you are a solo ranger. You always try to develop your skills by pursuing new knowledge simply for the sake of your enrichment.\n\nYou will have a strong ego and it is not in your true nature to mingle with other people. You prefer to be very different from other ego and it is not in your very nature to mingle with other people because you become too engaged in what you want to achieve in life.\n\nYou would be the first one to offer help to anyone in need, and you would do it without expecting anything back. You give a lot of freedom to your partners, and you are an extremely confident and optimistic person.\n\nYou will have a special ability to display your feelings with combined emotion with desire quickly so that you can communicate at an emotional level.\n\nYou will have a flame of fire burning deep inside you and you choose quality over quantity in friendship. You believe in creating and exploring new things with relationships.\n\nYou have the quality of being very stubborn about getting your way. You may also be prone to temper tantrums and become unpredictable.",
